``` Windows brute force / password spraying from EventCode 4625. ATT&CK T1110.001 / T1110.003 ```
index=wineventlog EventCode=4625 (Logon_Type=3 OR Logon_Type=10)
| bin _time span=15m
| stats count AS failures dc(Account_Name) AS unique_accounts values(Account_Name) AS accounts BY _time Source_Network_Address
| eval pattern=case(unique_accounts>=5, "password spraying", failures>=15, "brute force", true(), null())
| where isnotnull(pattern)
| sort - failures
